            <ArticleTitle>One year in review 2017: idiopathic inflammatory myopathies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>875-884</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Every year new concepts about pathogenesis, serology, diagnosis and treatment in inflammatory myopathies (IIMs) have been provided. The purpose of this manuscript is to summarise the most relevant literature contributions published over the last year about these complex and rare diseases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
